Short:        SAS/C SCOpts replacement
Author:       Manolis S. Pappas (ms.pappas@freemail.objsystem.it)
Uploader:     Manolis S  Pappas (ms pappas freemail objsystem it)
Type:         dev/gui
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

Project Type: an unfinished next generation SAS/C frontend.
Compiler: SAS/C v6.5 and up
AmigaOS: 2.0 and up
Requires: MUI includes
Description: an attempt I've made to create a new frontend for 
             SAS/C, using MUI. Unfortunately, university studies
             never let me finish it...

